		<description><![CDATA[<p>Francesco Scognamiglio dressed the biggest pop music icons, from Madonna to Lady Gaga, from Rihanna to J.Lo, but no one [...]</p>
<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/francesco-scognamiglio-madonna-is-the-most-special/20140715">Stylist Francesco Scognamiglio: &#8220;Madonna is the most special&#8221;</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna new album news unapologetic</a>.</p>
]]></description>
				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><strong>Francesco Scognamiglio</strong> dressed the biggest pop music icons, from <strong>Madonna</strong> to Lady Gaga, from Rihanna to J.Lo, but <strong>no one is as special as Madonna</strong> for the Italian fashion designer. And now <strong>Scognamiglio</strong> would like to dress Miley Cyrus, because &#8220;she really has a great energy.&#8221;</p>
<blockquote class="pixcode  pixcode--testimonial  testimonial testimonial--small-text">
    <div class="testimonial__content">
<p>The most special [pop music icon] to me was <strong>Madonna</strong>. It was thanks to her that all the others noticed my fashion creations and started to request them.</p>
</div>

    
        
            <div class="testimonial__author-name">Francesco Scognamiglio</div>
        
        
        
    </blockquote>

<p>&#8220;Fashion is a religion to me,&#8221; adds <strong>Francesco Scognamiglio</strong>. He designed <strong>Madonna</strong>&#8216;s dress for the Grammys and her 2010 Oscars dress.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/francesco-scognamiglio-madonna-is-the-most-special/20140715">Stylist Francesco Scognamiglio: &#8220;Madonna is the most special&#8221;</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna new album news unapologetic</a>.</p>
