				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><strong>Gwyneth Paltrow transforms into Madonna for Max Factor</strong> new ads to celebrate its 100 Years of Glamour campaign.</p>
<p><strong>Gwyneth Paltrow</strong> used <strong>Max Factor</strong> make-up to transform into &#8220;glamorous heroines from varying decades&#8221; including <strong>Madonna</strong>. The campaign aims to recreate iconic looks but with a modern twist.</p>
<p>Other inspirational beauties were Audrey Hepburn, Brigitte Bardot and Farrah Fawcett.</p>
<p><strong>Gwyneth Paltrow transforms into Madonna</strong> of the early 80s.</p>
