		<description><![CDATA[<p>Disney actress and singer Zendaya is the new face of Material Girl by Madonna and Lola. Zendaya was selected to [...]</p>
<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/zendaya-new-face-material-girl-madonna/20140619">Zendaya is the new face of Material Girl by Madonna and Lola</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna new album news unapologetic</a>.</p>
]]></description>
				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Disney actress and singer <strong>Zendaya</strong> is the new face of <strong>Material Girl</strong> by <strong>Madonna</strong> and Lola. <strong>Zendaya</strong> was selected to be featured in the label’s ad campaign entitled Boardwalk Babe. Starting in August <strong>Zendaya</strong> will be in magazines, online &amp; in Macy&#8217;s stores.</p>
<blockquote class="twitter-tweet" width="550"><p>Starting in August Zendaya will be in magazines, online &amp; in Macy&#39;s stores promoting juniors brand &quot;Material Girl&quot;! <a href="http://t.co/CjWOc2mIDE">pic.twitter.com/CjWOc2mIDE</a></p>
<p>&mdash; Zenliyah (@ZendayaMedia) <a href="https://twitter.com/ZendayaMedia/statuses/479515656166322176">June 19, 2014</a></p></blockquote>
<p><script async src="//platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"></script></p>
<p><strong>Zendaya</strong> follows in the footsteps of Rita Ora.</p>
<blockquote class="pixcode  pixcode--testimonial  testimonial testimonial--small-text">
    <div class="testimonial__content">
<p><strong>Zendaya</strong> exudes a confident, free spirit. We love having her as the new face of <strong>Material Girl</strong></p>
</div>

    
        
            <div class="testimonial__author-name">Madonna</div>
        
        
        
    </blockquote>

<p><strong>Zendaya</strong> was photographed by Jeremy Williams in a series of playful imagery at the Coney Island boardwalk in Brooklyn.</p>
<blockquote class="pixcode  pixcode--testimonial  testimonial testimonial--small-text">
    <div class="testimonial__content">
<p>I love how <strong>Zendaya</strong> makes her own style rules to fit her personality — that’s who <strong>Material Girl</strong> is all about, being yourself to the fullest</p>
</div>

    
        
            <div class="testimonial__author-name">Lola</div>
        
        
        
    </blockquote>

<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/zendaya-new-face-material-girl-madonna/20140619">Zendaya is the new face of Material Girl by Madonna and Lola</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna new album news unapologetic</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
